WEBVTT

00:11:27.912 --> 00:11:30.412
I write comic books
and graphic novels for a living.

00:11:30.454 --> 00:11:32.662
Now I'm a full-time artist.

00:11:32.704 --> 00:11:34.412
If I hadn't written that book,

00:11:34.454 --> 00:11:36.704
none of you would be listening
to me right now.

00:11:37.746 --> 00:11:40.371
And listen, my parents
weren't wrong to warn me

00:11:40.412 --> 00:11:42.829
about the lethal tendencies
of this country.

00:11:42.871 --> 00:11:44.121
Just last year,

00:11:44.162 --> 00:11:46.121
a white supremacist sent me death threats

00:11:46.162 --> 00:11:48.954
over a book that I hadn't
even finished writing yet.

00:11:48.996 --> 00:11:51.996
But obviously the only reason
he was threatened

00:11:52.037 --> 00:11:54.537
is because he recognized the power of art

00:11:54.579 --> 00:11:58.037
to change hearts and minds
all the way across the world.

00:11:59.537 --> 00:12:01.371
So I say to you now,